{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0004133 glycogen debranching enzyme activity \n[see [GO-ONTOLOGY TICKET]](https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29864#issuecomment-2702977701)\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WUE8gubyFXu6ox8w_d9Z8Sljr2n1UqBLwQ3jYRRGnMA/edit?gid=0#gid=0\nImpacted groups: \n\n2 CGD\n1 EcoCyc\n1  FlyBase - DONE\n1 MGI\n\nConsider: \n4-alpha-glucanotransferase activity | GO:0004134 (EC:2.4.1.25)\nand\namylo-alpha-1,6-glucosidase activity | GO:0004135 (EC:3.2.1.33)\nOR\nNTR corresponding to EC 3.2.1.196 (limit dextrin alpha-1,6-maltotetraose-hydrolase) (GO:0120549; just created today) \n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n1 UniRule\n1 HAMAP\n1 InterPro\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-03-06T12:34:33Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0004133 glycogen debranching enzyme activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-10T12:25:40Z"}
